WEBVTT

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:52.946
No way.

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:57.909
I can't believe he beat all
the Hadokyu up to 107.

00:02:01.496 --> 00:02:02.664
That's enough!

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.583
Hadokyu 108!

00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:09.671
Duke Home Run!

00:02:18.013 --> 00:02:20.390
Because Gin Ishida cannot continue to play,

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.726
Duke Watanabe of the first string wins!

00:02:23.101 --> 00:02:24.894
Of course.

00:02:25.603 --> 00:02:26.521
Ishida-<i>kun</i>!

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:36.781
If I hadn't gone all-out,

00:02:37.198 --> 00:02:39.617
that might have been me.

00:02:42.454 --> 00:02:44.998
The third U-17 Japanese team versus

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:49.085
second string shuffle match will now begin.

00:02:50.295 --> 00:02:56.301
"Betrayal and Negotiation"

00:02:56.301 --> 00:02:58.053
"Duke"
"Atobe"
"Niou"

00:02:58.053 --> 00:03:02.223
"Duke"
"Atobe"
"Niou"
Mind if we play the third match?

00:03:04.809 --> 00:03:07.729
If there are no objections,
then we have a deal.

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:11.649
Come, pompadoured four-eyes.

00:03:13.276 --> 00:03:16.196
He's asking for us, Marui-<i>kun</i>.

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:19.074
You're the one he asked for.

00:03:20.784 --> 00:03:24.996
Representing the U-17 Japanese
team are No. 8, Atsukyo Tono,

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:27.457
and No. 7, Ikuto Kimijima.

00:03:27.457 --> 00:03:31.336
They will be playing against Eishiroh Kite
and Bunta Marui of the second string.

00:03:32.754 --> 00:03:34.923
Time for the execution.

00:03:35.382 --> 00:03:37.050
Yeah, yours.

00:03:38.677 --> 00:03:40.261
Yeah!

00:03:40.261 --> 00:03:42.263
Go, Eishiroh!

00:03:43.473 --> 00:03:45.392
Best of three set match!

00:03:45.392 --> 00:03:47.185
First string to serve!

00:03:52.107 --> 00:03:54.526
Kite-<i>san </i>and Marui-<i>san</i>'s doubles...

00:03:54.943 --> 00:03:56.486
Can they make it work?

00:03:59.489 --> 00:04:00.448
Now then...

00:04:01.199 --> 00:04:03.743
Time for a public execution.

00:04:05.745 --> 00:04:10.083
Execution Method 13: Beheading!

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:15.130
Bunta!

00:04:15.672 --> 00:04:16.756
That guy...

00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:19.426
He hit him on purpose!

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.724
Is that allowed?

00:04:27.475 --> 00:04:30.353
It's fine. He didn't hit me.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.150
Gum?

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:40.071
If that frustrated you,

00:04:41.364 --> 00:04:42.991
try hitting me this time.

00:04:47.078 --> 00:04:49.956
Don't let him overwhelm you, Kiteretsu.

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:51.875
Don't worry about me.

00:04:57.005 --> 00:04:59.674
Your right corner is wide open.

00:05:01.468 --> 00:05:04.095
Not paying attention, Marui-<i>kun</i>?

00:05:04.554 --> 00:05:05.972
Shukuchiho!

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:07.682
Oh?

00:05:08.141 --> 00:05:09.392
Then how about this?

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:15.648
Eishiroh can reach anywhere
on the court in one step!

00:05:18.777 --> 00:05:21.905
Incredible! He's blocking all
their attacks by himself!

00:05:24.366 --> 00:05:25.909
Yeah...

00:05:25.909 --> 00:05:28.244
His exceptional defense

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:30.580
sets him apart.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:34.084
Stunt: Tightrope Walking!

00:05:34.876 --> 00:05:35.919
Game, second string!

00:05:35.919 --> 00:05:37.212
One game to love!

00:05:38.254 --> 00:05:40.757
The second string broke their
serve right off the bat!

00:05:41.466 --> 00:05:42.926
Aren't I a genius?

00:05:43.301 --> 00:05:46.721
You take all the glory, don't you?

00:05:53.603 --> 00:05:56.272
Kite returns every shot with his Shukuchiho,

00:05:56.898 --> 00:06:00.777
while Bunta-<i>kun </i>never lets an
opportunity to strike escape.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.823
They're definitely the right men for the job.

00:06:06.157 --> 00:06:10.203
I didn't think those two would
make such a good doubles team.

00:06:11.579 --> 00:06:14.624
They're ideal doubles partners.

00:06:14.916 --> 00:06:17.669
Taka-<i>san</i>, you go too far...

00:06:21.548 --> 00:06:22.507
Game, second string!

00:06:22.507 --> 00:06:24.050
Three games to love!

00:06:30.432 --> 00:06:31.266
Hmph.

00:06:31.266 --> 00:06:33.393
You've got us on the ropes.

00:06:34.519 --> 00:06:37.355
You truly are an ideal doubles team.

00:06:37.731 --> 00:06:40.233
He won't high five me, though.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.318
By the way, Bunta-<i>kun</i>,

00:06:42.318 --> 00:06:44.863
the way you make the ball
roll on top of the net...

00:06:45.613 --> 00:06:46.865
You mean Tightrope Walking?

00:06:47.949 --> 00:06:50.535
Will you show me that again?

00:06:51.244 --> 00:06:52.203
Okay.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:01.421
The Negotiator on the Court is making his move.

00:07:01.421 --> 00:07:02.922
Negotiator?

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:04.549
What's that?

00:07:19.731 --> 00:07:20.690
Got it!

00:07:21.358 --> 00:07:22.233
Stunt...

00:07:27.781 --> 00:07:29.783
They're baiting you, Marui-<i>kun</i>!

00:07:31.785 --> 00:07:32.660
Damn!

00:07:37.207 --> 00:07:38.375
Love-fifteen!

00:07:40.168 --> 00:07:41.169
Game, first string!

00:07:41.169 --> 00:07:42.587
Three games to one!

00:07:43.838 --> 00:07:44.839
Game, first string!

00:07:44.839 --> 00:07:46.383
Three games to two!

00:07:47.801 --> 00:07:50.595
They're throwing off Bunta-<i>kun</i>'s rhythm.

00:07:50.595 --> 00:07:56.309
They're gunning for him by breaking up
his increased rate of attack opportunities.

00:07:57.143 --> 00:07:58.144
Game, first string!

00:07:58.144 --> 00:07:59.521
Three games all!

00:08:01.773 --> 00:08:04.192
You're in too big a hurry, Marui-<i>kun</i>.

00:08:04.567 --> 00:08:08.405
Why aren't you waiting for your opportunity?

00:08:10.031 --> 00:08:11.866
Sorry, Kiteretsu.

00:08:14.244 --> 00:08:18.081
That's right. Since he asked to
see my Tightrope Walking again,

00:08:18.081 --> 00:08:21.459
I've been matching Kimi-<i>sama</i>'s pace.

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:27.549
Okay.

00:08:28.591 --> 00:08:31.553
I just need to focus on doing my job.

00:08:35.849 --> 00:08:37.475
Marui-<i>kun</i>, watch out!

00:08:47.652 --> 00:08:50.238
I said to try hitting me!

00:08:51.281 --> 00:08:54.367
You can dodge them from the front,

00:08:54.367 --> 00:08:56.161
but what about from front <i>and </i>back?

00:09:03.793 --> 00:09:04.836
Kiteretsu,

00:09:05.337 --> 00:09:06.171
did you...

00:09:07.714 --> 00:09:10.550
Eishiroh, what are you doing?

00:09:11.551 --> 00:09:14.012
You did that on purpose, didn't you?!

00:09:14.012 --> 00:09:17.015
Y-You can't do that! C-Control yourself!

00:09:17.307 --> 00:09:20.518
And after I called them the ideal doubles team.

00:09:20.518 --> 00:09:21.853
Now they've ruined it.

00:09:21.853 --> 00:09:23.980
Save the lectures.

00:09:26.441 --> 00:09:29.861
Let me give you all a word of caution.

00:09:30.945 --> 00:09:35.283
"Side with the strong" is my motto.

00:09:37.077 --> 00:09:38.828
Kiteretsu...

00:09:40.955 --> 00:09:42.332
We've already

00:09:44.542 --> 00:09:46.294
made a deal.

00:09:47.796 --> 00:09:49.798
The Negotiator, huh?

00:09:49.798 --> 00:09:51.216
I see.

00:09:53.301 --> 00:09:55.387
What did you want to discuss?

00:09:55.845 --> 00:10:00.183
I actually have a favor to ask of the Hitman.

00:10:01.559 --> 00:10:03.645
I want you to destroy him.

00:10:14.322 --> 00:10:16.908
This is starting to look shady.

00:10:27.585 --> 00:10:30.005
Kiteretsu, what are you doing?

00:10:30.422 --> 00:10:32.674
Stop your whining!

00:10:34.134 --> 00:10:37.887
Execution Method 12: Electric Chair!

00:10:40.098 --> 00:10:41.141
Game, first string!

00:10:41.141 --> 00:10:42.726
Four games to three!

00:10:43.601 --> 00:10:45.770
D-Damn it...

00:10:47.105 --> 00:10:49.232
Don't just sit there.

00:10:49.232 --> 00:10:50.942
Switch sides.

00:10:52.318 --> 00:10:53.778
Kite...

00:11:00.118 --> 00:11:03.663
Looks like he finally understands his situation.

00:11:04.122 --> 00:11:06.875
They lost the lead.

00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:09.753
This isn't even doubles at all.

00:11:09.753 --> 00:11:12.464
It's three versus one.

00:11:26.978 --> 00:11:30.273
That's enough!

00:11:31.191 --> 00:11:33.360
Bring it on, Kite!

00:11:46.831 --> 00:11:49.584
Damn! He's merciless!

00:11:50.585 --> 00:11:52.629
But if I just face forward,

00:11:52.629 --> 00:11:55.840
I can handle their flanking attacks
without losing balance...

00:11:57.258 --> 00:12:01.262
That's Higa Middle School's
Hirakoba's Giant Habu!

00:12:01.262 --> 00:12:05.767
The Higa team learned most of
their techniques from Eishiroh!

00:12:07.936 --> 00:12:09.646
Game and first set, first string!

00:12:09.646 --> 00:12:13.233
Kimijima-Tono pair, six games to three!

00:12:13.817 --> 00:12:14.567
Bunta!

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.529
Are you okay, Marui-<i>san</i>?

00:12:17.821 --> 00:12:19.781
Marui-<i>kun</i>, are you okay?

00:12:23.159 --> 00:12:25.537
Kite, you bastard...

00:12:26.746 --> 00:12:28.623
How obnoxious.

00:12:28.623 --> 00:12:30.291
What are you looking at?

00:12:35.588 --> 00:12:36.589
Him?

00:12:36.589 --> 00:12:37.340
Yes.

00:12:38.008 --> 00:12:41.219
I want you to injure Atsukyo Tono
beyond hope of recovery.

00:12:44.097 --> 00:12:48.018
Kimijima, you have some
impressive negotiating skills!

00:12:49.686 --> 00:12:55.150
I've been wanting to end my doubles
partnership with Tono for a while.

00:12:56.317 --> 00:13:00.530
I want you to betray your partner and help us,

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:02.407
so Tono will let down his guard.

00:13:03.867 --> 00:13:04.868
That's...

00:13:05.869 --> 00:13:07.287
Viking Horn!

00:13:13.585 --> 00:13:15.795
You're a mess.

00:13:15.795 --> 00:13:19.132
Get on your feet, Marui-<i>kun</i>.

00:13:21.009 --> 00:13:23.845
You've got quite the personality, too.

00:13:23.845 --> 00:13:25.555
I've changed my mind about you.

00:13:27.432 --> 00:13:29.476
Thank you.

00:13:35.106 --> 00:13:37.400
If we are successful,

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.986
I will recommend you for my doubles partner.

00:13:40.403 --> 00:13:42.322
Not a bad deal, is it?

00:13:42.322 --> 00:13:46.659
Did you think I would trust you?

00:13:46.659 --> 00:13:48.620
Don't underestimate me.

00:13:49.496 --> 00:13:51.122
Excuse me.

00:13:53.249 --> 00:13:56.920
His fatal flaw is an old injury
in his left knee.

00:13:57.921 --> 00:14:00.965
Must suck to have your friend betray you!

00:14:00.965 --> 00:14:03.843
Let's see how long you can last!

00:14:06.805 --> 00:14:09.307
He gets excited during an execution,

00:14:09.307 --> 00:14:13.311
and focuses too much attention on that,
creating a moment's opening.

00:14:13.311 --> 00:14:15.814
Strike then with one decisive blow.

00:14:16.523 --> 00:14:19.109
You'll get only once chance.

00:14:19.109 --> 00:14:21.069
Yippee ki-yay!

00:14:23.071 --> 00:14:23.863
Now!

00:14:25.824 --> 00:14:29.703
Kite, I'm not letting you
have the ball anymore!

00:14:30.078 --> 00:14:32.122
H-He's taking the defensive...

00:14:34.332 --> 00:14:35.959
Wonder Castle!

00:14:48.096 --> 00:14:50.557
Are you going to try to
return them all yourself?

00:14:52.142 --> 00:14:54.477
Let's see how long you can keep that up!

00:14:57.564 --> 00:14:59.399
Wonder Castle...

00:14:59.399 --> 00:15:04.320
Marui's been working on it since
he arrived at this training camp.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:08.366
It's a non-aggressive, impregnable defense.

00:15:13.663 --> 00:15:17.584
It was still incomplete yesterday.

00:15:19.336 --> 00:15:20.754
Incredible.

00:15:20.754 --> 00:15:24.424
He hasn't let a single shot past him.

00:15:25.091 --> 00:15:27.594
Marui-<i>kun </i>really intends to fight on his own.

00:15:29.054 --> 00:15:33.725
Even when faced with adversity,
he only uses it to grow.

00:15:37.729 --> 00:15:39.481
Playtime is over!

00:15:39.481 --> 00:15:41.733
Execution Method 11...

00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:45.111
We just have to climb over the castle wall.

00:15:46.321 --> 00:15:48.573
Stay out of my way, Kimijima!

00:15:49.783 --> 00:15:50.867
Damn it!

00:15:52.994 --> 00:15:54.162
That's it!

00:15:54.496 --> 00:15:56.331
You get him!

00:15:56.706 --> 00:16:01.002
You truly are impressive.

00:16:04.547 --> 00:16:05.090
He's good.

00:16:06.132 --> 00:16:08.009
You beat me,

00:16:09.219 --> 00:16:10.387
Marui-<i>kun</i>.

00:16:14.808 --> 00:16:16.184
What's going on?

00:16:16.184 --> 00:16:17.977
He should've been aiming for Bunta,

00:16:17.977 --> 00:16:19.437
but he hit Kimijima!

00:16:19.771 --> 00:16:24.442
Eishiroh missing a Habu is 100% impossible.

00:16:24.442 --> 00:16:25.568
Which means...

00:16:26.319 --> 00:16:28.405
He hit him on purpose.

00:16:31.074 --> 00:16:32.784
That's right.

00:16:34.577 --> 00:16:37.706
Does this mean the deal is off?

00:16:38.456 --> 00:16:42.460
Didn't I tell you I side with the strong?

00:16:43.044 --> 00:16:47.382
Marui-<i>kun</i>, defend with your
Wonder Castle at the net.

00:16:47.382 --> 00:16:50.385
I'll attack from behind.

00:16:50.385 --> 00:16:52.220
You can keep going, right?

00:16:54.889 --> 00:16:56.558
Can I trust you?

00:17:04.566 --> 00:17:09.320
Bunta-<i>kun</i>'s Wonder Castle allows him
to return everything at the net.

00:17:12.574 --> 00:17:15.493
If they lob the ball over Marui's head...

00:17:18.079 --> 00:17:19.039
Game, second string!

00:17:19.039 --> 00:17:20.498
One game to two!

00:17:21.124 --> 00:17:23.418
...it falls victim to Kite's Giant Habu.

00:17:23.668 --> 00:17:26.421
Yes! They're about to start the counterattack!

00:17:26.421 --> 00:17:27.797
It's perfect!

00:17:27.797 --> 00:17:30.091
The ideal doubles team is back!

00:17:34.054 --> 00:17:37.932
Hitting curve balls from
behind that castle wall...

00:17:38.767 --> 00:17:41.853
You two are tough.

00:17:42.479 --> 00:17:45.023
Let's remove the 60% limiter, To--

00:17:48.443 --> 00:17:49.569
Tono-<i>kun</i>...

00:17:51.321 --> 00:17:53.531
This is unexpected.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:57.994
He's already exceeded 60%.

00:18:00.121 --> 00:18:01.039
Game, second string!

00:18:01.039 --> 00:18:02.707
Two games all!

00:18:02.707 --> 00:18:05.210
They finally caught up!

00:18:05.794 --> 00:18:06.836
Want some gum?

00:18:07.295 --> 00:18:08.546
No, thank you.

00:18:09.422 --> 00:18:11.633
How dare they...

00:18:12.425 --> 00:18:16.096
High school members of the
U-17 team can't continue

00:18:16.096 --> 00:18:20.058
to disgrace themselves
against middle schoolers.

00:18:22.811 --> 00:18:25.897
I'm done slowly torturing you!

00:18:26.523 --> 00:18:29.818
Execution Method 11: Impalement!

00:18:30.485 --> 00:18:33.238
Execution Method 10: Crucifixion!

00:18:34.572 --> 00:18:38.159
By focusing on returning the ball,
I become unstoppable!

00:18:39.452 --> 00:18:41.287
Then take this!

00:18:41.287 --> 00:18:44.791
Execution Method 9: Dismemberment!

00:18:51.631 --> 00:18:53.091
Are you okay, Bunta?

00:18:57.929 --> 00:19:00.181
That wasn't on purpose, was it?

00:19:00.807 --> 00:19:04.185
Look. The gum chewer's come to die.

00:19:06.855 --> 00:19:08.273
Let's go, Kite.

00:19:08.648 --> 00:19:10.233
That's the spirit.

00:19:10.233 --> 00:19:13.111
I'm not done executing you!

00:19:16.823 --> 00:19:20.035
I know it's a coincidence,
but it's such a shame.

00:19:20.035 --> 00:19:23.621
The right side of your castle
wall has been destroyed!

00:19:32.172 --> 00:19:34.758
They beat the Wonder Castle.

00:19:34.758 --> 00:19:37.677
Marui can't react because his vision

00:19:37.677 --> 00:19:39.721
on the right side is blocked.

00:19:46.227 --> 00:19:47.395
Kiteretsu...

00:19:47.812 --> 00:19:50.273
Stand back.

00:19:51.816 --> 00:19:55.695
I know this isn't enough to repay you, but...

00:19:58.698 --> 00:20:02.118
Execution Method 8: Burned at the Stake.

00:20:03.286 --> 00:20:04.162
Kite!

00:20:07.332 --> 00:20:08.833
I can't watch this.

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:13.254
Hey, where are you going? Watch the game.

00:20:14.214 --> 00:20:15.715
The bathroom.

00:20:15.715 --> 00:20:17.092
Wanna come with me?

00:20:17.092 --> 00:20:18.301
No, thanks.

00:20:24.099 --> 00:20:27.477
Hey, are you going to the
bathroom too, Echizen?

00:20:29.437 --> 00:20:31.106
You have a match coming up.

00:20:31.106 --> 00:20:32.440
Don't get carried away.

00:20:33.191 --> 00:20:34.359
Got it.

00:20:45.745 --> 00:20:47.747
This is totally one-sided.

00:20:47.747 --> 00:20:51.626
He's just torturing him to death.

00:20:53.795 --> 00:20:57.382
This is the execution you pride yourself on?

00:20:57.382 --> 00:21:00.093
It's not even working.

00:21:00.093 --> 00:21:03.013
I wouldn't turn it into
a bloodbath <i>that </i>quickly.

00:21:04.055 --> 00:21:06.975
Once you've tasted all thirteen executions,

00:21:06.975 --> 00:21:11.938
your whole body will be paralyzed.
You won't even be able to lift a finger.

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:16.026
You've still got seven to go.

00:21:23.158 --> 00:21:27.871
You're the one who was
supposed to be executed.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:34.085
But no matter.

00:21:34.085 --> 00:21:37.130
He's not the only one I negotiated with.

00:23:18.273 --> 00:23:19.441
"Next Time"

00:23:19.441 --> 00:23:21.317
"Next Time"
Let's go another round, Mister Oni!

00:23:21.317 --> 00:23:22.569
Let's go another round, Mister Oni!

00:23:22.569 --> 00:23:25.447
Come back for more hell, Kintaro?

00:23:25.447 --> 00:23:28.867
I trained hard at the top of that cliff.

00:23:28.867 --> 00:23:30.827
Of course I'm stronger now!

00:23:30.827 --> 00:23:33.872
The results of your training
on the cliff? Interesting.

00:23:33.872 --> 00:23:35.707
Allow me to test you!

00:23:35.707 --> 00:23:40.045
The next episode of <i>New Prince of Tennis </i>is:
"Embrace the Ten Ball Strike and Sleep."

00:23:40.045 --> 00:23:42.464
"Embrace the Ten Ball Strike and Sleep"
More, Kintaro!

00:23:42.464 --> 00:23:44.049
